<title>USA: Sparta, Ill won by Edward D. Jones.</title>
<headline>Sparta, Ill won by Edward D. Jones.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edward D. Jones said it won $1 million of Sparta, Ill, combined waterworks &amp; sewerage system refunding &amp; improvement alternate bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.94 percent.</p>
</text>
